  so normal client windows occlude both instead of the marker bleeding through.
- build: require CK Core Motif ABI 9 headers and runtime symbols, build against
  the current toolkit in ARM64 CI, and record the exact Motif revision used.
- validation: run the complete CDE check suite and a real Xsession desktop smoke
  test, recording process, mapped-library, screenshot, and documentation evidence.
- dtksh: fix command lookup through changed PATH values; preserve the real shell
  executable identity in the check launcher and gate legacy AST universe cases
  that rely on Solaris PATH semantics not supplied by Linux.

2026-02-02
