  single spaces.
- dtterm: persist the last selected Options -> Font Size choice in ~/.dt/dttermrc
  and restore it for new instances unless a saved session provides a font size.
- dtfile: align drag hotspots with the click position using state icons and
  explicit hot spot handling, plus shelf drag adjustments and color fixes.
- dtfile: escape quotes and backslashes in command action file arguments, and
  handle escaped single quotes in command parsing so filenames containing
  single quotes, double quotes, or backslashes can be opened.
- dtfile/dticon: add image-content icons, extra-large presentation, additional
  zoom levels, centered file-list and shelf layouts, and corrected shelf double
  click, context-menu, drag, and color behavior.

